node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/out
# Copying build-info while excluding dist is an inconsistent pair: `tsc -b`
# reads the info, concludes everything is already compiled, and emits almost
# nothing into a dist that does not exist. The build then fails on missing
# declarations far from the cause.
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.sandbox
.git
.github
.claude
*.log
